§§ `Rule 12 -- attachment of debts, etc.`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

DECLARE `o 59 r 12(1) kind of order` IS ONE OF
    `o 59 r 12(1)(a) an order for the attachment of debts under Order 22`
    `o 59 r 12(1)(b) an order for the appointment of a receiver under Order 13, Rule 9`
    `o 59 r 12(1) another kind of order`

-- (1): "No order (a) for the attachment of debts under Order 22; or (b) for the appointment of a receiver under Order 13, Rule 9,
-- may be made or have effect in respect of any money due or accruing due, or alleged to be due or accruing due, from the Government."
