    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the application is one under section 19(4)`)
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): rule 13(1) speaks of "Every application to the Court under section 19(4)"
        IF document EQUALS Summons
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): a bare "must be made by summons"; QB: NOTHING (O 3 r 2(4)) / other: JUST FALSE

